WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:08.920
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

01:35.200 --> 01:38.920
ADAPTED FROM JIA JIN CHAI, ORIGINAL NOVEL
BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:42.960 --> 01:43.840
Here.

01:45.280 --> 01:46.600
Have some more.

01:49.040 --> 01:50.440
-Mother.
-Have some more.

01:50.520 --> 01:52.240
Look how well-behaved this parrot is.

01:52.320 --> 01:54.280
His Majesty is still so devoted to you.

01:54.360 --> 01:55.640
Whenever he gets something fine,

01:55.720 --> 01:58.120
-he sends it to Changle Palace first.
-Look at you.

01:58.200 --> 01:59.240
Mother!

02:00.640 --> 02:03.120
Mother, my brother is going to kill
every member of the Han clan!

02:03.200 --> 02:05.640
Xiao, what are you talking about now?

02:05.720 --> 02:07.960
You already caused
enough trouble last time!

02:08.039 --> 02:09.600
Have you no manners at all?

02:11.120 --> 02:11.960
Mother,

02:12.480 --> 02:14.240
the Han clan is in grave danger.

02:14.320 --> 02:16.360
The Marquis of Xiting
and his son are in prison.

02:16.880 --> 02:17.960
The Empress is under house arrest too!

02:22.640 --> 02:24.960
I'm not dead yet,

02:25.040 --> 02:26.520
and he's already turned on the Han clan?

02:27.120 --> 02:28.920
Quick, summon him at once!

02:29.520 --> 02:30.600
Go!

02:33.000 --> 02:35.360
Mother, don't worry.

02:36.240 --> 02:40.400
ABUNDANT GRACE, AUSPICIOUS TIMES

02:40.480 --> 02:42.680
You must get this letter
out of the palace.

02:45.560 --> 02:46.440
Keep it safe.

02:49.240 --> 02:51.240
-Rest assured, Your Majesty.
-Go.

02:56.080 --> 02:57.480
JIAOFANG PALACE

03:04.840 --> 03:06.240
Stop.

03:22.480 --> 03:24.280
Lady Li has arrived!

03:27.920 --> 03:28.960
Greetings, Your Ladyship.

03:34.520 --> 03:36.480
His Majesty is angry for the moment,

03:36.560 --> 03:38.000
but he'll show mercy
once his anger subsides.

03:38.960 --> 03:40.320
She is still the Empress.

03:41.240 --> 03:42.880
Show her some respect.

03:51.000 --> 03:54.360
All provisions for Jiaofang Palace
must continue as before.

03:54.440 --> 03:57.160
Anyone who uses this to
deny her provisions or mistreat her

03:57.680 --> 04:00.400
will face severe punishment if I find out.

04:01.200 --> 04:02.320
Yes.

04:04.160 --> 04:05.560
JIAOFANG PALACE

04:05.640 --> 04:06.480
Tell me,

04:07.080 --> 04:09.160
what was the Empress trying to do?

04:09.240 --> 04:10.400
With her situation so desperate,

04:10.920 --> 04:12.800
she must have sent
a letter outside to seek help.

04:13.480 --> 04:15.080
Since you knew,

04:15.160 --> 04:17.160
why did you have me let her messenger go?

04:18.120 --> 04:20.959
Because Your Ladyship told me
His Majesty is deeply suspicious

04:23.160 --> 04:24.480
and thinks of everything.

04:25.240 --> 04:29.040
Once the eunuch leaves the palace,
whichever household's back door he enters,

04:29.120 --> 04:31.560
the Commandant's Office
will find out exactly where he went.

04:35.920 --> 04:38.600
My daughter is so clever.

04:38.680 --> 04:40.600
How could I have been so foolish,

04:41.760 --> 04:44.480
thinking that get you out of
these disputes would keep you safe?

04:49.080 --> 04:50.760
You had your own concerns, Your Ladyship.

04:52.400 --> 04:57.360
My daughter was always destined to
be drawn into palace politics.

05:03.160 --> 05:04.280
This time,

05:05.160 --> 05:06.760
I'm not after power.

05:09.040 --> 05:10.240
I'm after justice.

05:11.200 --> 05:13.200
XUANSHI PALACE

05:13.280 --> 05:15.080
His Majesty has only placed
the Empress under house arrest

05:15.160 --> 05:16.160
and has yet to make a decision.

05:16.880 --> 05:18.480
Could the Han clan still make a comeback?

05:19.480 --> 05:20.880
As long as the Empress Dowager is alive,

05:21.400 --> 05:23.080
His Majesty has to tread carefully.

05:23.160 --> 05:24.680
Then what do we do?

05:24.760 --> 05:26.040
Just let the Empress Dowager
meddle in state affairs?

05:26.720 --> 05:28.040
Han Liao got endless blood debts.

05:28.120 --> 05:29.960
Do we just watch him walk free again?

05:30.560 --> 05:32.040
Is there any justice left?

05:33.000 --> 05:34.480
I'll plead with His Majesty again.

05:37.160 --> 05:38.960
Justice isn't won by
begging on your knees.

05:39.960 --> 05:41.440
You have to risk lives and fight for it.

05:42.080 --> 05:43.120
You…

05:44.680 --> 05:45.760
Your Highness.

05:46.640 --> 05:47.760
Your Highness, wait.

05:50.400 --> 05:52.360
The Marquis of Xiting
and his son plotted treason.

05:52.440 --> 05:53.680
His Majesty is furious.

05:54.320 --> 05:55.920
Please leave it for your own sake.

05:56.600 --> 05:59.880
Don't provoke His Majesty now
and bring trouble on yourself.

06:03.040 --> 06:03.960
This is outrageous, Your Highness.

06:04.640 --> 06:05.880
Forgot where you are now?

06:06.520 --> 06:08.520
How dare you strike
someone outside Xuanshi Palace?

06:10.960 --> 06:13.000
Prince Jing is my brother's eldest son.

06:13.520 --> 06:16.200
The Han clan is
the Emperor's maternal family.

06:16.280 --> 06:17.680
Our family affairs

06:17.760 --> 06:20.800
are not for outsiders
like you to interfere with!

06:21.520 --> 06:24.200
If you dare slander us
before my brother again,

06:24.280 --> 06:27.120
I'll skin you alive!

06:28.160 --> 06:29.720
I wouldn't dare delay
your business, Your Highness.

06:31.360 --> 06:32.400
Please, go ahead.

06:37.240 --> 06:38.360
What a wretched place!

06:41.040 --> 06:41.960
Unbelievable.

06:42.040 --> 06:43.960
His Majesty had him
reflect on his conduct at home,

06:44.040 --> 06:45.320
yet he's grown more arrogant.

06:46.040 --> 06:47.600
That's exactly what we want.

06:49.680 --> 06:51.080
The more carried away he gets, the better.

06:55.360 --> 06:56.840
Your Majesty, take a good look.

06:56.920 --> 07:00.000
Every one of these memorials
pleads for mercy on the Han clan.

07:00.600 --> 07:02.120
The Empress is your first wife,

07:02.200 --> 07:03.480
and Prince Jing is your eldest son.

07:03.560 --> 07:05.600
What has made you so heartless?

07:05.680 --> 07:08.360
Do you care nothing
for the bonds of marriage

07:08.440 --> 07:09.440
or your own flesh and blood?

07:10.040 --> 07:12.440
Mother has a message for you.
If you want to wipe them out,

07:13.040 --> 07:14.560
she is one of the Hans.

07:15.080 --> 07:19.200
You might as well abandon your filial duty
and cut off your old mother's head too,

07:19.280 --> 07:21.440
so you can go down in history

07:21.520 --> 07:23.920
as a just ruler
who spared not even his own kin!

07:34.720 --> 07:37.640
The Empress
is consumed by jealousy and malice

07:38.520 --> 07:39.480
and is cruel at heart.

07:40.200 --> 07:42.800
She is unfit to honor the ancestors
or serve as a mother to the realm.

07:43.400 --> 07:45.640
I hereby strip her of her rank

07:46.400 --> 07:47.360
and condemn her to Yongxiang,
the palace prison.

07:48.400 --> 07:51.880
Prince Jing has failed to cultivate virtue
and engaged in treason.

07:52.520 --> 07:54.080
For the sake of
our bond as father and son,

07:54.720 --> 07:55.800
I spare his life,

07:56.720 --> 07:59.560
strip him of his rank,
and banish him to Hanzhong Commandery.

08:00.080 --> 08:02.640
The Han clan still refuses to confess?

08:03.840 --> 08:05.280
Tell Boyao to use severe torture.

08:06.200 --> 08:07.960
If he fails to get answers,

08:08.480 --> 08:11.480
-I will hold him accountable!
-Yes, Your Majesty.

08:11.560 --> 08:12.840
Your Majesty…

08:12.920 --> 08:14.120
Utter another word,

08:14.200 --> 08:16.600
and you'll be dragged
out and beaten to death!

08:24.920 --> 08:28.080
Mother, my brother also said…

08:28.600 --> 08:29.440
What did he say?

08:30.080 --> 08:32.880
The Emperor is a son to Heaven and Earth,

08:32.960 --> 08:34.120
and father to all the people.

08:34.720 --> 08:36.280
To be a good emperor to his people,

08:36.360 --> 08:39.280
he can no longer be a good son to you.

08:39.799 --> 08:40.679
Fine.

08:42.159 --> 08:44.800
What an impartial emperor he is!

08:45.520 --> 08:47.920
Doesn't he want to kill
every member of the Han clan?

08:48.880 --> 08:50.000
He needn't trouble himself.

08:50.680 --> 08:52.800
I will dash my brains out
outside Xuanshi Palace.

08:53.400 --> 08:55.200
Let the whole world see

08:55.280 --> 08:59.880
what a heartless, cold-blooded son I have!

09:00.480 --> 09:02.400
Yes! We can't let him do as he pleases!

09:02.480 --> 09:05.000
Shut your mouth, you fool!

09:06.960 --> 09:09.640
Mother, please don't act rashly.

09:10.160 --> 09:12.920
Remember when
you refused to eat in the past?

09:13.920 --> 09:16.120
His Majesty attended to you himself,

09:16.200 --> 09:17.480
showing the utmost devotion as your son.

09:18.160 --> 09:20.160
But now you've had neither food nor water.

09:20.240 --> 09:22.520
Has His Majesty come to see you even once?

09:23.280 --> 09:28.240
However deep your bond,
it can't withstand this constant strain.

09:28.320 --> 09:31.520
Mother, you mustn't go.

09:31.600 --> 09:34.840
If you do, your bond as mother and son

09:34.920 --> 09:36.320
will be severed for good.

09:37.320 --> 09:42.400
I can't stand by and watch
the entire Han clan be killed!

09:44.120 --> 09:49.920
As things stand, we can only
sacrifice one to save the rest.

09:56.880 --> 09:59.520
By His Majesty's decree,
Han is stripped of her rank.

10:00.120 --> 10:02.920
Her seal is to be reclaimed, and
she must leave the Empress's palace

10:03.000 --> 10:04.360
and move to Yongxiang.

10:04.880 --> 10:06.000
Commoner Han, come with us.

10:06.600 --> 10:07.840
Impossible.

10:09.040 --> 10:10.000
This is impossible.

10:11.960 --> 10:13.200
It can't be.

10:13.920 --> 10:15.480
-You can't take my seal!
-Quick!

10:15.560 --> 10:16.800
-Get it back!
-It's mine!

10:16.880 --> 10:18.720
You can't take my seal!

10:18.800 --> 10:20.960
-Get it back!
-You can't take my seal!

10:21.040 --> 10:22.160
If I'm unworthy of it,

10:22.240 --> 10:24.520
no one else shall have it!

10:24.600 --> 10:26.640
How dare you break the Empress's Seal!

10:26.720 --> 10:27.680
Do you have a death wish?

10:27.760 --> 10:31.520
I'm the Empress,
the Empress Dowager's niece!

10:32.200 --> 10:34.000
His Majesty can't treat me like this.

10:34.760 --> 10:37.400
I want to see the Empress Dowager!

10:37.480 --> 10:38.760
Quick, after her!

10:51.800 --> 10:52.800
Your Majesty.

10:54.040 --> 10:55.240
It's you.

10:56.240 --> 10:58.000
How dare you come to gloat over me?

11:01.760 --> 11:03.160
You believed

11:04.200 --> 11:06.440
wealth and noble birth made you superior.

11:06.520 --> 11:09.240
People's lives meant nothing to you.

11:09.320 --> 11:10.480
You couldn't have cared less.

11:11.920 --> 11:15.080
Now, you're covered in dirt yourself
and look utterly pitiful.

11:16.000 --> 11:17.480
When you killed Bitao,

11:19.040 --> 11:20.480
did you think you'd see this day?

11:22.960 --> 11:25.040
What Bitao? I know nothing about her.

11:26.560 --> 11:29.800
She was my maid, my friend,

11:30.720 --> 11:33.000
and the one who stood by me
through years of hardship.

11:36.240 --> 11:39.280
-For a mere servant, you dare…
-I dare!

11:41.360 --> 11:44.000
For Bitao, for myself,

11:44.640 --> 11:47.560
for all those whose lives and dignity
you people trampled on at will,

11:47.640 --> 11:48.880
there's nothing I wouldn't dare!

11:50.080 --> 11:51.440
Such insolence!

11:52.000 --> 11:53.600
My aunt will save me.

11:54.480 --> 11:56.480
-The Empress Dowager…
-Between you and the Han clan,

11:58.960 --> 12:00.440
the Empress Dowager can save only one.

12:05.560 --> 12:07.160
From this day on,

12:08.120 --> 12:11.920
your noble blood
and immense power mean nothing.

12:13.920 --> 12:16.480
Only hard labor awaits you
for the rest of your life.

12:17.600 --> 12:18.720
For the rest of your life,

12:19.920 --> 12:21.840
you'll live in Yongxiang,

12:21.920 --> 12:24.400
cowering like a homeless
dog with its tail between its legs.

12:30.760 --> 12:31.760
Do you understand,

12:33.000 --> 12:34.520
Commoner Han?

12:36.040 --> 12:38.120
I'll kill you, you vile woman!

12:38.200 --> 12:41.240
I'll kill you!

12:41.880 --> 12:44.240
Why are you letting a commoner
run wild in the palace?

12:44.920 --> 12:47.000
I'll kill you, you vile woman!

12:47.600 --> 12:49.680
I'll kill you!

13:00.280 --> 13:01.320
Lord Lu,

13:01.400 --> 13:03.600
Her Ladyship really isn't here.

13:03.680 --> 13:04.800
ZHUYU ESTATE

13:04.880 --> 13:07.920
Perhaps you could try looking up the hill.

13:11.080 --> 13:12.480
So she plans to go back on her word.

13:12.560 --> 13:14.240
Her word? What do you mean?

13:15.800 --> 13:18.840
Tell her she can't avoid me forever.

13:20.240 --> 13:23.960
However long she puts it off,
she'll have to give me what she owes me.

13:51.600 --> 13:53.560
-Your Ladyship.
-If Lord Lu comes,

13:53.640 --> 13:54.640
just say Her Ladyship isn't here.

13:55.240 --> 13:57.920
It's General Qi this time, not Lord Lu.

13:58.680 --> 14:01.080
He says he has good news for Her Ladyship.

14:01.160 --> 14:03.560
I didn't dare decide on my own.

14:04.600 --> 14:06.880
-Ask him to come over.
-Yes.

14:16.440 --> 14:17.480
Wei Rao!

14:18.160 --> 14:19.080
Wei Rao.

14:23.240 --> 14:25.120
You've refused to
see Lu Zhuo on three visits.

14:25.800 --> 14:26.680
Just hiding out doing farm work, huh?

14:28.080 --> 14:29.200
Something urgent?

14:29.880 --> 14:31.320
I came especially to tell you

14:32.000 --> 14:33.320
the Marquis of Xiting
has killed himself in prison.

14:36.120 --> 14:37.200
The Marquis of Xiting is dead?

14:37.960 --> 14:40.000
Lu Zhuo kept up the pressure at every turn

14:40.080 --> 14:41.720
until the Han clan
had nowhere left to turn.

14:42.640 --> 14:44.800
The Marquis took poison and left a letter,

14:45.320 --> 14:48.480
claiming those 120 suits of armor
were meant to be buried with him.

14:48.560 --> 14:49.400
MARQUIS OF XITING'S RESIDENCE

14:49.480 --> 14:50.920
Since they were grave goods,

14:51.000 --> 14:52.280
and the Empress Dowager
tearfully pleaded for mercy,

14:52.800 --> 14:54.000
His Majesty showed leniency

14:54.080 --> 14:55.720
and didn't convict
the Han clan of treason,

14:55.800 --> 14:57.840
but of illegally hoarding weapons instead.

14:58.360 --> 15:00.360
Their title was revoked
and their property confiscated.

15:00.440 --> 15:03.160
Han Liao was also demoted three ranks
and left to serve in the army in disgrace.

15:04.200 --> 15:07.240
Too bad Han Liao escaped the worst.

15:10.640 --> 15:12.320
Of all the Han clan's members at court,

15:12.920 --> 15:14.680
few dare fight on the battlefield.

15:15.400 --> 15:17.520
Most of them were pushed out
of the court's core.

15:18.160 --> 15:19.320
That's why the Empress Dowager
fought so hard to protect him.

15:19.920 --> 15:22.480
Is that all you came to tell me, General?

15:22.560 --> 15:24.080
There's something even more important.

15:24.160 --> 15:27.120
At court today, His Majesty named
Prince Duan as Crown Prince.

15:28.960 --> 15:29.880
I see.

15:38.680 --> 15:40.080
-Wei Rao…
-I only wanted

15:40.160 --> 15:41.560
the murderers to be punished.

15:42.400 --> 15:44.160
My wish came true. I have no regrets.

15:44.760 --> 15:48.560
Who becomes Empress or Crown Prince
has nothing to do with me.

15:49.160 --> 15:51.720
You don't care about state affairs,
or you are avoiding Lu Zhuo?

15:55.680 --> 15:58.560
What exactly did you promise him
that makes you so afraid of him?

16:05.680 --> 16:07.800
The chickens escaped! Catch them!

16:08.480 --> 16:09.680
Come and help!

16:10.760 --> 16:12.280
Aman, catch them!

16:23.920 --> 16:24.800
Don't run!

16:28.680 --> 16:31.040
-I'll block it here!
-Why is this so hard?

16:31.120 --> 16:33.360
Come here.

16:39.840 --> 16:40.840
Don't run!

16:42.320 --> 16:43.240
Got it!

16:43.320 --> 16:44.280
Catch it!

16:55.920 --> 16:59.000
She died in Shuzhou,
and both her children are missing.

17:00.240 --> 17:01.320
-You may go.
-Yes.

17:03.280 --> 17:06.319
-My Lady, word has come from Shuzhou.
-Over here!

17:06.400 --> 17:07.880
Madam Qiao fell ill and passed away.

17:08.440 --> 17:10.200
Her two children's
whereabouts are unknown.

17:10.880 --> 17:11.920
What did you say?

17:12.440 --> 17:13.520
-This one.
-Two wen.

17:13.599 --> 17:14.720
Fresh pastries!

17:14.800 --> 17:15.880
Here you are.

17:15.960 --> 17:16.960
Thank you.

17:17.040 --> 17:18.119
Let's go.

17:18.640 --> 17:20.760
Fresh pastries!

17:27.920 --> 17:28.760
Before Mother died,

17:29.440 --> 17:31.880
she kept telling us to
come back and find Rao.

17:31.960 --> 17:32.800
But look at you.

17:32.880 --> 17:34.480
You could be living in comfort,

17:34.560 --> 17:35.680
yet you're out here selling
flatbreads from dawn till dusk.

17:41.840 --> 17:45.280
Listen to me. We should
ask her for a few gold coins.

17:46.040 --> 17:48.120
Mother saved her life.
How could she refuse?

17:50.200 --> 17:51.400
Have you no shame?

17:51.920 --> 17:54.720
No girl has it worse
than one without a mother's love.

17:55.360 --> 17:57.040
Her birth mother didn't want her.

17:57.120 --> 17:59.040
The mother who raised her
fed her soup made from wild greens,

17:59.880 --> 18:01.520
and her whole family bled her dry.

18:02.440 --> 18:05.080
The money she gave us
was more than enough for the funeral.

18:05.600 --> 18:08.320
I can earn my own living. I'm not going.

18:13.640 --> 18:14.760
You…

18:14.840 --> 18:16.080
Skip today, you'll go tomorrow.

18:16.160 --> 18:17.120
If she refuses me,

18:17.200 --> 18:18.240
-Give that back!
-I'll shout it in the streets!

18:18.320 --> 18:20.840
Runsheng! Don't go gambling again!

18:21.560 --> 18:22.560
Excuse me.

18:22.640 --> 18:24.000
I'd like two sesame flatbreads.

18:26.400 --> 18:27.840
Two wen each.

18:27.920 --> 18:28.960
I'll take two.

18:40.080 --> 18:42.120
-You're back, Hongxian.
-Yes, Mr. Wang.

18:53.560 --> 18:54.880
Let go of me!

18:56.800 --> 18:58.680
Let go! Let go of me!

18:58.760 --> 19:00.560
Let go of me!

19:02.120 --> 19:03.520
Help!

19:03.600 --> 19:07.560
Help! Help! Let go!

19:07.640 --> 19:08.480
HOUSE OF FORTUNE

19:08.560 --> 19:11.480
All bets are final once placed!

19:11.560 --> 19:12.880
Place your bets!

19:13.600 --> 19:16.480
High!

19:16.560 --> 19:17.600
Low!

19:19.720 --> 19:21.840
-Again!
-Again!

19:21.920 --> 19:24.320
-High!
-Place your bets!

19:37.680 --> 19:40.560
What are you staring at? Behave!

20:06.120 --> 20:07.280
Did they abduct you too?

20:10.000 --> 20:12.720
My father's a constable.
He'll come and rescue me.

20:13.560 --> 20:14.640
Once I'm out,

20:14.720 --> 20:17.440
I'll have him arrest these traffickers
and have them beheaded.

20:29.440 --> 20:30.480
There's a banquet here tomorrow.

20:31.160 --> 20:32.560
Don't spend all your time
drinking and gambling.

20:33.200 --> 20:34.480
Keep a close watch on them.

20:35.160 --> 20:36.200
Understood.

20:41.800 --> 20:43.200
Food's ready. Gather around.

20:43.800 --> 20:45.120
Stop dawdling! Hurry!

20:45.800 --> 20:48.080
Hurry! What are you waiting for?
Stop dawdling!

20:48.840 --> 20:49.680
Hurry up!

20:49.760 --> 20:51.480
Do you two want to eat or not?

20:51.560 --> 20:52.440
Hurry.

20:52.520 --> 20:54.000
Move. You stink. Take it.

21:04.280 --> 21:05.320
Come on.

21:06.000 --> 21:07.120
What are you doing? Stop them!

21:07.200 --> 21:08.520
Stay inside!

21:08.600 --> 21:09.520
-Go after them!
-Get back!

21:12.920 --> 21:15.160
Stop! Stop them!

21:15.240 --> 21:17.560
-After them! Don't let them escape!
-Stop!

21:19.080 --> 21:20.520
-Stop!
-Stop!

21:22.240 --> 21:24.080
The potted plum trees
from the Empress Dowager

21:24.160 --> 21:25.600
will go here.

21:26.480 --> 21:27.720
Yes.

21:28.520 --> 21:29.640
Your Highness,

21:29.720 --> 21:32.120
this is a congratulatory
gift from the Censor-in-Chief.

21:32.200 --> 21:33.680
This natural black stone

21:33.760 --> 21:36.200
has white veins like
rolling, snow-white waves.

21:37.960 --> 21:39.320
It's a rare find indeed.

21:40.080 --> 21:41.560
The bamboo grove
outside His Highness's study

21:41.640 --> 21:43.120
could use an ornamental rock.

21:43.200 --> 21:44.520
Have it taken there.

21:44.600 --> 21:45.600
Yes.

21:46.760 --> 21:50.160
Shu, now that you're Crown Princess,

21:50.240 --> 21:51.600
you no longer have
to rely on anyone's favor.

21:51.680 --> 21:53.840
You can avenge Mother now, right?

21:55.200 --> 21:58.160
Chan, how many times have I told you?

21:58.240 --> 22:00.680
Sisters must support one another.

22:00.760 --> 22:03.120
We must never let infighting
give others an opening.

22:03.200 --> 22:06.760
Shu, have you forgotten
how much Mother loved you?

22:07.440 --> 22:08.840
You've forgotten all she did for you.

22:09.440 --> 22:10.920
I'm not speaking to you anymore.

22:11.840 --> 22:12.960
The greater good comes first.

22:13.040 --> 22:15.960
Help! Bandits!

22:16.040 --> 22:16.920
-Hold her down!
-Don't move!

22:17.000 --> 22:18.040
-What's going on?
-Help!

22:18.120 --> 22:19.000
Behave!

22:21.320 --> 22:22.120
Enough, Chan.

22:22.880 --> 22:25.560
You should go home.
Don't make Grandmother worry.

22:26.400 --> 22:28.240
-Escort Lady Chan home.
-Yes.

22:29.680 --> 22:30.960
This way, Lady Chan.

22:40.440 --> 22:42.440
BEHOLD THE WAVES

22:42.520 --> 22:45.200
We have a guest here. Why all this noise?

22:47.240 --> 22:49.000
-Behave!
-Let go!

22:52.160 --> 22:53.360
Your Highness,

22:53.440 --> 22:56.200
we've been very busy these past two days.

22:56.280 --> 22:58.560
Some maids got into
trouble and are being punished.

22:58.640 --> 22:59.640
We wouldn't want to trouble you with this.

23:00.400 --> 23:01.400
Take them away.

23:02.320 --> 23:03.640
Your Ladyship! Your Ladyship!

23:04.240 --> 23:05.240
Please save us!

23:05.320 --> 23:08.240
-They abducted me!
-Take her away! Quickly!

23:09.200 --> 23:10.920
-Your Ladyship! Your Ladyship!
-My sister is Noble Lady Wu'an!

23:12.040 --> 23:13.840
Abducting a noble lady's
sister is punishable by death!

23:13.920 --> 23:14.760
Let me go at once,

23:14.840 --> 23:16.360
or neither Heaven
nor the law will spare you!

23:17.040 --> 23:18.360
Stop! Let go of her.

23:23.200 --> 23:24.160
Your Ladyship,

23:24.680 --> 23:26.320
I really am Noble Lady Wu'an's sister.

23:26.920 --> 23:28.680
Send someone to Zhuyu Estate.

23:28.760 --> 23:30.000
If my sister knows you've freed me,

23:30.080 --> 23:34.120
she'll reward you handsomely
and repay your kindness.

23:41.040 --> 23:42.640
What exactly is going on?

23:42.720 --> 23:45.280
There are many
more girls locked back there.

23:45.360 --> 23:47.440
They were all abducted and brought here.

23:47.520 --> 23:50.000
If you don't believe me,
Your Ladyship, go and see for yourself.

23:54.600 --> 23:55.680
Lead the way.

24:07.720 --> 24:09.720
Come on. We're saved.

24:26.520 --> 24:28.520
They're all so young.

24:28.600 --> 24:29.880
These poor girls.

24:31.840 --> 24:34.000
Your Ladyship, we were all abducted!

24:34.080 --> 24:36.880
Your Ladyship!
Let us go home, Your Ladyship!

24:36.960 --> 24:37.840
Your Ladyship, let us go home!

24:37.920 --> 24:39.640
You're kind and merciful.

24:39.720 --> 24:41.160
Please save us!

24:41.240 --> 24:42.760
Save us!

24:42.840 --> 24:45.440
Please let us go home, Your Ladyship!

24:45.520 --> 24:46.520
Your Ladyship!

24:54.600 --> 24:56.400
You can't even
handle something this simple.

24:57.320 --> 24:58.720
What use are you?

25:13.440 --> 25:17.040
Deal with those who tried to escape
in the usual way.

25:17.120 --> 25:18.160
Yes.

25:43.800 --> 25:46.760
I'll haunt you even after I die!

25:48.680 --> 25:50.600
No!

25:52.760 --> 25:56.120
Even with her dying breath,
she had to curse me.

25:57.680 --> 25:59.480
Drive a peachwood sword through her heart,

26:00.280 --> 26:01.920
cut out the tongue
she planned to use against us,

26:02.520 --> 26:05.800
burn her to ashes, and bury
them beneath the garden paving.

26:05.880 --> 26:07.280
Let countless feet trample her.

26:08.240 --> 26:10.280
Let's see how her spirit haunts me then.

26:17.200 --> 26:21.720
You claim to be Noble Lady Wu'an's sister.

26:22.800 --> 26:24.880
When did the Wei family
gain a girl like you?

26:25.640 --> 26:26.760
How did I not know?

26:26.840 --> 26:30.520
Lying is a bad habit, but don't worry.

26:31.080 --> 26:32.360
I can rid you of it.

26:33.360 --> 26:34.200
Is everything ready?

26:35.440 --> 26:36.680
She's different from the others.

26:36.760 --> 26:38.520
His Highness had her brought here.

26:43.520 --> 26:44.520
Bring it in.

26:49.920 --> 26:51.320
No!

26:51.920 --> 26:53.520
Wei Rao really is my sister!

26:54.520 --> 26:55.680
I'm not lying!

26:55.760 --> 26:58.280
Please let me go! I'm not lying!

26:58.360 --> 27:00.040
If you're lying, I won't let you go.

27:00.640 --> 27:02.080
If it's true, all the more reason
to keep you here.

27:03.280 --> 27:05.200
The moment you set foot in this residence,

27:05.760 --> 27:07.880
you lost any chance of ever leaving.

27:09.040 --> 27:11.440
Lowly girl, how dare
you claim kinship with a noble lady?

27:15.840 --> 27:17.680
Use molten lead as the key ingredient

27:20.480 --> 27:22.760
to cure her of these outrageous lies.

27:23.880 --> 27:27.160
Please spare me!

27:27.840 --> 27:29.200
-Give her the medicine.
-Please!

27:30.000 --> 27:32.480
No!

27:34.280 --> 27:37.640
No!

27:51.400 --> 27:53.520
Many honored guests will be here tomorrow.

27:54.440 --> 27:58.400
Make sure
the little birds out back keep quiet.

27:59.280 --> 28:00.240
Yes.

28:03.960 --> 28:05.040
Rao!

28:05.560 --> 28:07.040
Rao!

28:07.120 --> 28:11.320
Rao, save me! Save me!

28:11.400 --> 28:12.680
Rao!

28:17.920 --> 28:18.880
What's wrong, My Lady?

28:19.480 --> 28:22.400
I heard Hongxian's voice.
She was calling for me.

28:23.360 --> 28:26.760
All the estate's guards are out searching.
If she really has returned to the capital,

28:27.480 --> 28:28.680
they'll find her.

28:29.440 --> 28:30.800
Please don't worry, My Lady.

28:32.720 --> 28:36.880
You're attending a banquet
at the Crown Prince's residence today.

28:37.560 --> 28:39.520
Let me help you wash and dress.

28:39.600 --> 28:41.560
No need. I'll do it myself.

28:42.600 --> 28:45.720
I've already told them
to report to you immediately

28:45.800 --> 28:47.200
as soon as they have any leads.

28:51.720 --> 28:54.240
Have them check
every gambling house in the capital too.

28:56.440 --> 28:57.560
Yes.

29:07.200 --> 29:10.000
-Come next time.
-Take care.

29:10.080 --> 29:11.800
-It's fresh.
-Sir, come and have a look!

29:11.880 --> 29:13.320
Come and see!

29:13.400 --> 29:15.240
SILKS AND FINE FABRICS

29:20.680 --> 29:21.600
Lord Lu.

29:22.200 --> 29:24.400
My Lady, it's Lord Lu.

29:30.680 --> 29:32.680
I'm in a hurry to attend
the Crown Prince's banquet.

29:33.200 --> 29:34.120
Please let us pass, Lord Lu.

29:35.080 --> 29:36.880
Lord Lu has a few words for Your Ladyship.

29:36.960 --> 29:38.800
He'll leave once heard.
Please step out of the carriage.

29:44.120 --> 29:45.760
What's so urgent, Lord Lu,

29:47.000 --> 29:48.000
that you had to stop me here?

29:53.240 --> 29:54.440
What are you doing?

29:55.880 --> 29:56.920
I have guards with me.

29:57.640 --> 29:58.920
Your Ladyship promised

29:59.640 --> 30:00.680
that once we brought down our enemies,

30:01.280 --> 30:02.600
you'd take me back.

30:03.440 --> 30:05.680
Were you only stringing me along?

30:07.720 --> 30:09.880
You barged into my room
in the middle of the night,

30:10.400 --> 30:13.160
threatened me, tempted me,
and did all the talking.

30:13.240 --> 30:14.480
I never agreed to anything.

30:18.280 --> 30:21.600
Your Ladyship really is two-faced
and never keeps a promise.

30:21.680 --> 30:23.320
You haven't even crossed the river,

30:23.400 --> 30:25.080
yet you're rushing to
tear the bridge down.

30:28.600 --> 30:29.880
But I have my pride too.

30:30.680 --> 30:32.120
I won't keep pestering you.

30:42.040 --> 30:43.240
Rest assured.

30:44.120 --> 30:45.600
I won't mention this again,

30:47.600 --> 30:49.320
and you needn't avoid me like the plague.

30:50.600 --> 30:51.440
Really?

30:55.200 --> 30:56.200
Unless you beg me yourself,

30:57.320 --> 30:58.720
I won't bring it up again.

30:58.800 --> 31:00.720
Beg you? Dream on.

31:01.800 --> 31:04.000
How generous of you,
Lord Lu. I'll be on my way.

31:05.520 --> 31:06.640
Wait.

31:10.840 --> 31:11.880
Zhao Bai.

31:19.200 --> 31:21.960
He's strong and skilled
at riding and archery.

31:22.040 --> 31:24.480
He's also well-versed in music
and knows how to be good company.

31:25.040 --> 31:26.880
He can cheer you up when you're troubled.

31:27.640 --> 31:30.240
Are you offering me
Deputy General Zhao, Lord Lu?

31:30.840 --> 31:34.200
At today's banquet,
you'll have no shortage of such offers.

31:35.000 --> 31:36.080
Not that I'd be invited.

31:36.760 --> 31:37.880
Do try to keep your composure

31:37.960 --> 31:41.040
and avoid being
taken advantage by the schemers.

31:53.400 --> 31:56.200
Your Ladyship,
what did Lord Lu say to you?

31:57.320 --> 32:00.120
Odd remarks.
I couldn't make sense of them.

32:00.200 --> 32:01.160
Pay him no mind.

32:03.120 --> 32:06.320
‎-Sure.
‎-Good.

32:06.880 --> 32:08.480
You can certainly hold your liquor!

32:30.000 --> 32:31.440
Congratulations, Your Highness.

32:39.160 --> 32:40.360
All right.

32:41.280 --> 32:42.560
Have a drink too.

32:47.920 --> 32:50.000
Your Ladyship, please.

32:54.120 --> 32:55.080
Keep your distance.

32:55.800 --> 32:58.000
He's strong and skilled
at riding and archery.

32:58.080 --> 32:59.800
He's also well-versed in music
and knows how to be good company.

33:00.840 --> 33:03.720
At today's banquet,
you'll have no shortage of such offers.

33:03.800 --> 33:05.200
So that's what he meant.

33:20.080 --> 33:21.440
The one in there is lucky.

33:21.520 --> 33:22.960
His Highness has his eye on her.

33:23.040 --> 33:25.760
Otherwise, she'd be buried tonight too.

33:25.840 --> 33:27.120
He'll lose interest in a couple of days.

33:28.600 --> 33:30.200
The Crown Princess is quite something.

33:30.280 --> 33:32.400
She likes letting them escape,
then catching them again.

33:32.480 --> 33:33.920
We should learn a few new tricks.

33:34.000 --> 33:36.120
Make His Highness laugh,
and he'll reward us handsomely.

33:36.200 --> 33:37.360
All right, enough.

33:45.800 --> 33:47.840
You little charmer.

33:49.760 --> 33:52.000
This is your first banquet
of this kind, Your Ladyship.

33:52.080 --> 33:52.920
You'll get used to it.

33:53.520 --> 33:54.640
I'm not like them.

33:56.080 --> 33:57.280
Have a drink!

33:59.000 --> 34:01.080
Cheng was meant for
the Eldest Princess's Residence.

34:01.160 --> 34:03.520
But the Crown Princess said,
His Highness owes his success

34:03.600 --> 34:04.560
to Your Ladyship.

34:04.640 --> 34:06.840
So His Highness sent
Cheng to attend to you.

34:08.760 --> 34:10.040
Fill it up!

34:21.159 --> 34:22.320
Take it away.

34:34.320 --> 34:36.239
How fortunate I am to
meet an old friend tonight.

34:37.560 --> 34:39.320
Yet Your Ladyship
doesn't seem to recognize me.

34:40.239 --> 34:43.440
Now that you've risen in the world,
have you forgotten your old friends?

34:44.080 --> 34:45.440
Do you remember the Liu family's mill?

34:54.600 --> 34:55.760
A-Chou.

35:11.480 --> 35:14.400
There are many things about this world
that Your Ladyship finds distasteful.

35:15.000 --> 35:17.120
But nobles have
their eggs painted before eating them

35:17.200 --> 35:19.400
and patterns carved into their firewood.

35:20.440 --> 35:23.040
As the saying goes,
"the Emperor treasures pearls and jade,

35:23.120 --> 35:24.640
and feudal lords, gold and stone.

35:25.240 --> 35:28.680
Ministers keep dogs and horses,
and commoners store cloth and silk."

35:29.440 --> 35:31.080
Know one's station,

35:31.160 --> 35:32.760
do one's part.

35:33.560 --> 35:36.600
Wealth and power are now
within Your Ladyship's reach.

35:36.680 --> 35:38.480
Others like you indulge in pleasure.

35:38.560 --> 35:40.520
You should feel free to enjoy it too.

35:42.800 --> 35:45.600
The Eldest Princess
has countless favorites.

35:45.680 --> 35:47.080
I won't trade on my looks.

35:47.600 --> 35:48.640
I willingly serve Your Ladyship.

35:49.280 --> 35:51.960
I may not be skilled in performances,
but I'm quick with numbers.

35:52.480 --> 35:54.520
I can stay by your side as a trusted aide.

35:55.880 --> 35:58.600
Will you take me with you, Your Ladyship?

36:12.440 --> 36:14.320
I knew you still remembered me.

36:19.200 --> 36:21.120
Who said Wu'an couldn't be won over?

36:22.560 --> 36:24.440
You really are a thoughtful cousin.

36:25.480 --> 36:27.240
Your gift was just what she wanted.

36:39.560 --> 36:40.480
See?

36:41.000 --> 36:43.360
Everyone's the same, after all.

36:43.880 --> 36:49.160
CROWN PRINCE'S RESIDENCE

36:51.280 --> 36:53.520
My Lord, you already warned Her Ladyship.

36:53.600 --> 36:55.000
She'll surely be on her guard.

36:56.000 --> 36:56.960
Not necessarily.

36:58.440 --> 36:59.880
Real mind games, after all,

37:00.840 --> 37:01.920
few can stand against it.

37:02.920 --> 37:05.560
Then, My Lord,
why don't you attend the banquet yourself?

37:07.160 --> 37:09.800
She doesn't want to see me.
Why should I go?

37:15.000 --> 37:16.240
Let's go home.

37:17.480 --> 37:18.600
Let's go.

37:25.080 --> 37:27.360
She won't let those
handsome men fool her, will she?

37:39.040 --> 37:40.160
After her!

37:46.840 --> 37:49.080
Rao!

37:51.840 --> 37:52.960
Quick, after her!

38:03.800 --> 38:04.960
Split up!

38:06.600 --> 38:09.120
I'm done. No more for me.

38:11.360 --> 38:12.680
Dance with me.

38:25.920 --> 38:27.880
For that dish of phoenix tongues just now,

38:28.600 --> 38:30.720
it took the finest tongues from
over a thousand buntings

38:30.800 --> 38:32.400
just to fill one small plate.

38:33.760 --> 38:35.360
As for this meat stew,

38:35.440 --> 38:38.280
the steamed deer tails may smell strong,

38:39.200 --> 38:41.440
but that's what makes them so nourishing.

38:42.520 --> 38:44.040
Try some, everyone.

38:44.120 --> 38:46.960
Thank you, Your Highness!

38:56.640 --> 38:58.560
That's delicious.

39:06.600 --> 39:08.600
If you leave, His Highness will punish me.

39:09.760 --> 39:12.560
-Let go.
-Despite my warm hospitality,

39:13.680 --> 39:15.480
your cousin doesn't
seem to be enjoying herself.

39:24.000 --> 39:25.200
Your Ladyship, please take me with you.

39:32.920 --> 39:33.800
Let go.

39:35.720 --> 39:36.760
Your Ladyship…

39:37.720 --> 39:38.720
Rao.

39:42.520 --> 39:45.160
His Highness' appointment as Crown Prince,
you are chiefly to thank.

39:45.240 --> 39:48.600
Let me offer you a toast on his behalf.
Please drink the whole cup.

39:49.360 --> 39:50.240
You give me too much credit.

40:00.600 --> 40:02.080
Your Ladyship, we've found someone.

40:03.240 --> 40:05.200
There's urgent business at the estate.
I must return at once.

40:05.800 --> 40:07.760
Your hospitality has been most generous.
I'll thank you properly another day.

40:08.800 --> 40:10.040
Leaving so soon?

40:12.640 --> 40:16.200
Very well. I know what you're like.
I won't keep you.

40:17.240 --> 40:19.720
Cheng, go home with Her Ladyship.

40:20.320 --> 40:22.480
Be sure to serve her well.

40:25.360 --> 40:26.680
Did you fail to attend to her properly?

40:27.560 --> 40:30.440
Her Ladyship
seems reluctant to take you with her.

40:31.440 --> 40:33.600
Please take me in.
I'll work myself to the bone

40:33.680 --> 40:35.680
to repay your kindness.

40:35.760 --> 40:36.840
I have other urgent business.

40:36.920 --> 40:38.600
Aman, take him back to the estate.

40:55.720 --> 40:58.960
-Sure.
-Fill my cup again!

41:02.160 --> 41:03.880
What are you doing?
I was about to win my money back!

41:03.960 --> 41:06.320
Let go of me! Who are you?

41:08.160 --> 41:09.360
Who on earth are you?

41:10.000 --> 41:12.440
My sister is Noble Lady Wu'an!

41:13.040 --> 41:14.520
I'll have her deal with you!

41:20.480 --> 41:22.800
-Rao. What are you doing here?
-Where's Hongxian?

41:23.480 --> 41:25.280
I told her to come find you,
but she refused.

41:25.880 --> 41:28.280
-We rented an old house nearby.
-Take me there.

41:30.080 --> 41:32.840
Rao, do you have any gold coins?

41:33.680 --> 41:35.440
Lend… lend me some
so I can win my money back.

41:38.680 --> 41:39.880
Lead the way!

41:45.960 --> 41:47.080
Give it to me!

41:47.160 --> 41:48.680
-Hand it over!
-I saw it first!

41:48.760 --> 41:50.000
-Let go!
-I saw it first!

41:50.080 --> 41:51.560
-I took it, so it's mine!
-Give it to me!

41:51.640 --> 41:53.080
-Let go!
-You let go!

41:53.160 --> 41:54.000
Hand it over!

41:54.080 --> 41:55.520
-You've already taken so much!
-Give it to me!

41:56.560 --> 41:57.400
It's mine!

41:57.480 --> 41:59.000
-These belong to my family!
-You've already taken so much!

42:00.200 --> 42:01.520
You're stealing from us!

42:02.120 --> 42:03.080
She's never coming back.

42:03.680 --> 42:05.640
A hopeless gambler
like you can't run a business.

42:05.720 --> 42:07.160
All these would go to waste.

42:07.240 --> 42:08.440
-What's wrong with us taking a few?
-Exactly!

42:08.520 --> 42:09.360
You…!

42:10.480 --> 42:11.720
Oh, heavens!

42:11.800 --> 42:12.920
What do you mean, she's never coming back?

42:13.000 --> 42:14.320
Where did Hongxian go?

42:14.400 --> 42:17.840
She said it.
She said Miss Hongxian had been abducted,

42:17.920 --> 42:19.160
and there would be no one
to claim her belongings.

42:19.240 --> 42:20.400
That's why I came to take them.

42:20.480 --> 42:22.680
Spare me, Your Ladyship! Spare me!

42:22.760 --> 42:24.440
-What nonsense are you spouting?
-Spare me, Your Ladyship!

42:24.520 --> 42:26.160
You had to be so greedy!

42:26.240 --> 42:28.080
You already took so much,
yet you still fought me for a sieve!

42:28.160 --> 42:29.000
Who abducted Hongxian?

42:29.760 --> 42:31.960
As soon as Miss Hongxian left the alley,

42:32.040 --> 42:33.920
several burly men rushed at her.

42:34.000 --> 42:35.600
They gagged her, covered
her head, and took her away.

42:36.280 --> 42:38.800
-I don't know who they were.
-Which way did they go?

42:38.880 --> 42:40.000
Which way…

42:40.080 --> 42:41.400
Tell her!

42:41.480 --> 42:43.560
East! They went east!

42:43.640 --> 42:44.720
They went east.

42:50.280 --> 42:52.080
Easy!

42:53.120 --> 42:55.240
AS THE SUN RISES

42:56.440 --> 42:57.960
He's the biggest broker in this area.

42:58.040 --> 43:00.560
Every sale of a slave goes through him.

43:02.840 --> 43:03.840
Have you seen her?

43:05.040 --> 43:07.440
No. Never.

43:09.640 --> 43:10.480
Look carefully!

43:10.560 --> 43:12.320
I'm innocent!

43:12.400 --> 43:15.600
Spare me, Your Ladyship!
I really haven't seen her.

43:15.680 --> 43:17.640
-But…
-But what?

43:17.720 --> 43:18.920
To tell you both the truth,

43:19.520 --> 43:23.280
over the past two years,
many girls have gone missing in the city.

43:23.360 --> 43:25.840
The youngest are barely 13,
the oldest only 15 or 16.

43:25.920 --> 43:28.360
You turn your back for a moment,
and someone just vanishes.

43:29.320 --> 43:30.840
Haven't the authorities investigated?

43:30.920 --> 43:32.560
They're just girls from poor families.

43:32.640 --> 43:35.680
Who knows whether
they starved to death, died from hardship,

43:35.760 --> 43:38.720
were taken by traffickers,
or abducted by bandits?

43:38.800 --> 43:40.800
There's no way to trace what happened.

43:42.000 --> 43:46.920
Some refused to give up
and even petitioned the Court of Justice.

43:47.000 --> 43:49.360
But nothing ever came of it.

43:50.640 --> 43:52.320
Those powerful officials
only concern themselves

43:52.400 --> 43:54.400
with state affairs.

43:54.480 --> 43:56.800
Who would care about
what happens to poor families?

43:58.400 --> 44:00.600
Listen. Alive or dead, I want her found!

44:01.200 --> 44:02.880
Don't think you can
talk your way out of this!

44:02.960 --> 44:04.720
If I've told you a single lie,

44:04.800 --> 44:07.040
may a bolt of lightning
strike me dead on the spot!

44:07.880 --> 44:10.200
-Qi Zhongkai.
-Please don't hit me!

44:14.840 --> 44:17.240
Your Ladyship,
Lord Lu insisted on barging in.

44:17.320 --> 44:18.840
You couldn't have stopped him. It's fine.

44:19.760 --> 44:21.320
Even if you kill him tonight,

44:21.840 --> 44:23.280
there are things
he won't dare to tell you.

44:25.360 --> 44:26.240
Do you know who's behind this?

44:28.760 --> 44:30.080
I don't.

44:30.920 --> 44:33.080
But I know someone dares to abduct girls

44:33.160 --> 44:34.800
right in the capital,
acting without a care,

44:35.320 --> 44:36.760
committing crimes over the years,

44:38.240 --> 44:41.240
while the people dare not ask questions,
and the authorities dare not investigate.

44:42.920 --> 44:45.800
What kind of person has that much power?

44:47.280 --> 44:48.720
Someone of royal or noble blood.

44:50.000 --> 44:50.840
Could it be Prince Rong?

44:51.520 --> 44:53.680
It can't be. Prince Rong is lustful,

44:54.400 --> 44:56.760
but the women he favors
are beautiful, voluptuous widows.

44:57.800 --> 44:59.040
Everyone in the capital knows it.

44:59.960 --> 45:02.960
He just told us
the missing girls were all very young.

45:03.560 --> 45:07.040
Anyone who abducts girls
must have bought and sold them too.

45:07.920 --> 45:10.040
You run the city's largest brokerage.

45:10.120 --> 45:13.040
You know all the secret tastes
of the capital's rich and powerful.

45:13.640 --> 45:16.320
Tell us the truth,
and I'll let you live.

45:17.000 --> 45:19.840
I swear to Heaven,
I know nothing about it!

45:22.080 --> 45:23.960
My estate has taken
in many displaced people.

45:24.040 --> 45:26.640
Many brokers like you have tried to abduct

45:27.240 --> 45:29.400
and sell children and
young girls amid the chaos.

45:30.240 --> 45:32.560
Do you know what I do to them
once I find them?

45:34.200 --> 45:39.040
Her Ladyship's estate is orderly
because she has one ironclad rule.

45:39.120 --> 45:41.520
Anyone found abducting
and selling women or children

45:43.520 --> 45:44.920
is paraded through
the streets for three days,

45:46.480 --> 45:47.440
then executed by slow slicing.

45:48.720 --> 45:50.080
Do you know what slow slicing means?

45:50.800 --> 45:52.440
Three thousand cuts,

45:52.960 --> 45:54.040
carving you up while you're alive.

45:55.480 --> 45:57.000
No, please don't!

45:57.080 --> 46:00.480
I'll talk! I've only heard a few rumors.

46:00.560 --> 46:03.400
If word gets out,
my entire family will be killed!

46:05.240 --> 46:06.760
I'll talk!

46:06.840 --> 46:10.000
There are quite a few
powerful men in the capital

46:10.080 --> 46:12.120
with this taste,

46:12.200 --> 46:13.960
but the only one even the Commandant
of Justice won't dare investigate

46:14.760 --> 46:16.840
-is…
-Who?

46:16.920 --> 46:20.200
The Crown Prince.

48:41.440 --> 48:44.480
‎NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED
‎IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
